<title>UK: Premier Oil appoints new finance director.</title>
<headline>Premier Oil appoints new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Oil Plc said it appointed Edward Freeborn as its new finance director from April 30.</p>
<p>Freeborn, who most recently worked as director of corporate finance at Lucas Industries, will replace Tony Heath, who reaches retirement age in June.</p>
</text>
